        "Description": "Your target is Dino Bosco, famous actor and director with a great talent for acting, and managment. His darker side is orbiting around Edwards drug shipping lanes, and Mumbai underworld. His main co-drug runner, Gregory Arthur, is not here, but main part of his organisation is. You should eliminate 3 key members of his grid: Runner-M.Esposito, Accountant-F.Giordano, Administrator-V.Lombardi, and of couse the Leader-Dino Bosco. You should also eliminate their Sapienza connection, Isidoro Lorenzo",
